{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a flat chessboard, both sides engage in automatic battles based on their abilities, while players can pause the battle and choose to use each character's attached active skills to control the situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/12b0f37616c77e0f7cf204588afba8df.poster.avif?t=1765167599\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/12b0f37616c77e0f7cf204588afba8df.webm?t=1765167599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/12b0f37616c77e0f7cf204588afba8df.mp4?t=1765167599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By using different characters to continuously battle enemies with various styles, deepen your understanding of character abilities and additional skills to improve combat capabilities and challenge higher difficulty enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/42bda7724ec590a5363035e51a4e8c80.poster.avif?t=1765167599\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/42bda7724ec590a5363035e51a4e8c80.webm?t=1765167599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/42bda7724ec590a5363035e51a4e8c80.mp4?t=1765167599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/276792edd8ed1009185804a9971379b8.poster.avif?t=1765167599\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/276792edd8ed1009185804a9971379b8.webm?t=1765167599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/276792edd8ed1009185804a9971379b8.mp4?t=1765167599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After reaching a certain battle level, you can also challenge the endless abyss, experience more battle strategy combinations, the cooperation between different characters, and complete exciting battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/7631ebc84e7d2192d602a515e223f74b.poster.avif?t=1765167599\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/7631ebc84e7d2192d602a515e223f74b.webm?t=1765167599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/7631ebc84e7d2192d602a515e223f74b.mp4?t=1765167599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4088320?t=1765167599","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/b2e3194e0e86f523139e3cc83b63fff352304cba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765167599","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/2eb84b8f6114c7b7262dc13560a07a212be86cf0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765167599","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/2eb84b8f6114c7b7262dc13560a07a212be86cf0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765167599","categories":[{"descr